+*   **AbsGS Densification Interval:** 100 iterations [S1].
+*   **Batch Size:** 2 (indoor), 1 (outdoor) [S1].
+*   **Training Iterations:** 3,000 (Mip-NeRF 360, Deep Blending), 7,000 (Tanks & Temples) [S1].
+*   **Position Learning Rate Max Steps:** 3,000 (Mip-NeRF 360, Deep Blending), 7,000 (Tanks & Temples) [S1].
+*   **Split Factor:** $p=0.5$ is used to partially compensate for over-densification [S1].
